  "name": "Felsworn: Immolation Aura ticks do not trigger Dancing Blades (#13578)",
  "contract": [
    "Dancing Blades 92087 reads: 'Critical strikes with melee abilities now trigger Dancing Blades, dealing",
    "off-hand Weapon Damage to up to $800598i nearby enemies.' Immolation Aura (all ranks, active level-60",
    "rank 572617) applies SPELL_AURA_PERIODIC_TRIGGER_SPELL_WITH_VALUE (227, 3000 ms period, extra initial",
    "tick) triggering Immolation 800208 (DmgClass 2 SPELL_DAMAGE_CLASS_MELEE, SchoolMask 4 Fire,",
    "SPELL_EFFECT_SCHOOL_DAMAGE). Because 800208 carries DmgClass 2 and 92087 allows triggered procs",
    "(PROC_ATTR_TRIGGERED_CAN_PROC, needed for Twin Slice / Azzinoth's Assault / Annihilan Strike / Fury",
    "Unleashed), 800208 crits entered aura_ascension_felsworn_event case 92087 with melee=true,",
    "periodic=false and fired Dancing Blades 800598. Live CoA combat logs record 0/214 Dancing Blades",
    "triggers from isolated 800208 crits while melee abilities such as Twin Slice 803462/520243 trigger",
    "at 100%. The fix excludes 800208 from case 92087 in AscensionFelswornEvents.cpp.",
    "With melee crit guaranteed (melee_crit_rating 100000) and dual-wield weapons equipped (main-hand 25,",
    "off-hand 2092), Immolation Aura 572617 must produce at least 2 critical 800208 ticks on the dummy",
    "while triggering 0 casts and 0 hits of Dancing Blades 800598 (discriminating: fails without the fix).",
    "After cancelling Immolation Aura, casting Twin Slice 547211 must crit (803462) and trigger Dancing",
    "Blades 800598 (positive control)."
  ],
